---
title: How to compare two PDFs
description: Spot text and visual differences between PDF versions — private, in your browser.
relatedTool: compare-pdf
---

Review revisions side by side without uploading documents to a cloud service.

## Steps

1. Open **Compare PDF**.
2. Upload the original PDF and the revised PDF.
3. Review text differences per page, then switch to visual diff if needed.
4. Use the highlights to decide what changed.

## Tips

> **Tip:** For scanned documents, run OCR first so text comparison has content to work with.

